# ---- Ignore everything by default ----
*

# ---- But still walk into subdirectories ----
!*/

# ---- Allow only source files ----
!*.c
!*.cpp
!*.py

# ---- Optional: keep these too (delete if you don't want them) ----
!.gitignore
!*.h
!*.hpp
!README.md

# ---- CPH / tooling folders (must come LAST to override !*/ ) ----
.cph/
.cph-ng/
*.prob
.vscode/
